1
00:00:00,742 --> 00:00:02,912
(Howard:)You're awful quiet.
Everything OK?

2
00:00:03,878 --> 00:00:05,448
(Sheldon:)Not really.

3
00:00:05,613 --> 00:00:08,723
(Sheldon:)I had a bit
of an embarrassing evening.

4
00:00:08,883 --> 00:00:11,123
(Howard:)Me, too. What happened?

5
00:00:11,286 --> 00:00:13,126
(Sheldon:)I drank alcohol

6
00:00:13,288 --> 00:00:18,098
(Sheldon:)and may have left an unfortunate
voice mail for Stephen Hawking.

7
00:00:19,027 --> 00:00:20,567
(Howard:)I wouldn't worry about it.

8
00:00:20,728 --> 00:00:22,708
(Howard:)He's got a pretty good
sense of humor.

9
00:00:23,765 --> 00:00:25,545
(Sheldon:)I hope so.

10
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,700
(Sheldon:)What happened to you
last night?

11
00:00:27,869 --> 00:00:29,709
(Howard:)Well, turns out

12
00:00:29,871 --> 00:00:32,481
(Howard:)I'd already met the girl
Raj is seeing

13
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:36,280
(Howard:)when I did a number
on her bathroom.

14
00:00:39,414 --> 00:00:41,294
(Howard:)And that number was two.

15
00:00:43,818 --> 00:00:46,728
(Sheldon:)Well, you know,
I've always been a fan

16
00:00:46,888 --> 00:00:49,728
(Sheldon:)of a story told
by Attar of Nishapur,

17
00:00:49,891 --> 00:00:53,801
(Sheldon:)about a king,
who assembled a group of wise men

18
00:00:53,962 --> 00:00:57,642
(Sheldon:)to create a ring that would
make him happy when he was sad.

